# QUIRK Q-9: when graphics setup fails after the premultiplied-alpha effect was created, that effect
# is never destroyed (the teardown forgets it): the number of live graphics objects does not return
# to the value before the call. Informational: an implementation SHOULD free it; the vector records
# the reference behaviour (+1).
startup en-US -
live_mark
fake effect_fail solid.effect
reset_video
live_delta
fake effect_fail_clear 1
fake effect_fail default_rect.effect
reset_video
live_mark
reset_video
live_delta
